-- names ifacea's `IA.mth` -- `A` is an alias of `ifacea`, which exports no
-- standalone `mth`, only `IA.mth`. `Blob` implements only `IB` (method
-- `mthb`), never `IA`. Correct verdict: reject with `No impl of IA for Blob;
-- write an 'impl IA Blob'.` -- and it now does, on check/run/build alike.
-- Previously (base main, pre-fix): `medaka check` exited 0, `main : Unit`,
